{"series":{"id":"shrouding-heavens","slug":"shrouding-heavens","title":"Shrouding the Heavens","image":"https://donghualife.com/images/webp/shrouding-heavens-4__coverImage.webp","synopsis":"En las profundidades cósmicas donde coexisten el frío y la oscuridad, nueve cadáveres de dragones tiran de un antiguo ataúd de bronce, que existe desde la antigüedad.Esta es una imagen extremadamente impactante capturada por sondas espaciales en el universo desolado.Nueve dragones tirando del ataúd, ¿ha vuelto a la antigüedad o ha llegado al otro lado del cielo estrellado?Un vasto mundo de hadas, grotesco, misterioso e interminable. La sangre hierve como un volcán, la pasión surge como un vasto mar, y los deseos son infinitos como un abismo...Subiendo el camino al cielo, cantando canciones, y cubriendo el cielo con los dedos.","genres":["Acción","Cultivo","Aventura","Ciencia ficción","Isekai"],"sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/series/shrouding-heavens","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:25:44.940Z"},"seasons":[{"id":"shrouding-heavens-1","slug":"shrouding-heavens-1","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/shrouding-heavens-1-1","image":null,"number":1,"seriesId":"shrouding-heavens","firstEpisodeUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/shrouding-heavens-1-1","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:27:13.116Z","episodeCount":53,"minEpisodeFound":1,"maxEpisodeFound":53,"missingEpisodes":[],"paginationComplete":true,"initialSyncComplete":true},{"id":"shrouding-heavens-4","slug":"shrouding-heavens-4","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/shrouding-heavens-4-1","image":null,"number":4,"seriesId":"shrouding-heavens","firstEpisodeUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/shrouding-heavens-4-1","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:26:32.103Z","episodeCount":30,"minEpisodeFound":1,"maxEpisodeFound":30,"missingEpisodes":[],"paginationComplete":true,"initialSyncComplete":true}],"episodes":[{"id":"shrouding-heavens-1-1","slug":"shrouding-heavens-1-1","title":"Shrouding the Heavens — Cap. 1","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife